            ["firefox-debloat"]="Enterprise policies (telemetry, studies, default-browser agent, suggestions, FirefoxSuggest, crash auto-send) plus disabling the Default Browser Agent task by name pattern (its hash varies). Applies on next launch; reversible. Updates are never touched.",
            ["office-debloat"]="Disables the four Office telemetry agent tasks plus the documented OSM, feedback, privacy and FirstRun switches (HKCU). Office must be closed. Applies to the current user; reversible.",
